IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg8-s266-conversion-to-other-entities`

-- Tests of section 266 (conversion of a domestic corporation to other entities).
-- Every expected value was decided by reading the text of section 266 (src:1349-1370) and written here before running; none was copied from the code's output.

§ `Builders`

GIVEN k IS A `Kind of entity`
      w IS A `Where an entity is formed`
GIVETH AN Entity
`t266 entity` k w MEANS Entity WITH `kind of entity` IS k, `where formed` IS w

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A BOOLEAN, f IS A BOOLEAN, g IS A BOOLEAN, h IS A BOOLEAN, i IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 266(c) Certifications in the certificate of conversion`
`t266 certifications` a b c d e f g h i MEANS
    `s 266(c) Certifications in the certificate of conversion` WITH
        `s 266(c)(1) the certificate certifies the name of the corporation` IS a
        , `s 266(c)(1) the certificate certifies the name under which the corporation was originally incorporated` IS b
        , `s 266(c)(2) the certificate certifies the date of filing of its original certificate of incorporation with the Secretary of State` IS c
        , `s 266(c)(3) the certificate certifies the name and jurisdiction of the entity to which the corporation shall be converted` IS d
        , `s 266(c)(4) the certificate certifies that the conversion has been approved in accordance with the provisions of the section` IS e
        , `s 266(c)(5) the certificate certifies the agreement of the corporation that it may be served with process in the State of Delaware in any action, suit or proceeding for enforcement of any obligation of the corporation arising while it was a corporation of this State or of any obligation of the other entity arising from the conversion, including any suit or other proceeding to enforce the right of any stockholders as determined in appraisal proceedings pursuant to § 262` IS f
        , `s 266(c)(5) the certificate certifies that the corporation irrevocably appoints the Secretary of State as its agent to accept service of process in any such action, suit or proceeding` IS g
        , `s 266(c)(6) the certificate certifies the address to which a copy of the process shall be mailed to the corporation by the Secretary of State` IS h
        , `s 266(c)(7) the certificate certifies that all provisions of the plan of conversion shall be approved in accordance with the section` IS i

§ `s 266(a)`

-- Text: a corporation may, upon authorization in accordance with the section, convert to a limited liability company, statutory trust, business trust or association, real estate investment trust,
-- common-law trust or any other unincorporated business including a partnership, or a foreign corporation. Not to a corporation of this State; a natural person is no entity.
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a limited liability company` `another jurisdiction of the United States`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a limited liability company` `this State`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a statutory trust` `this State`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a business trust or association` `this State`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a real estate investment trust` `this State`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a common-law trust` `this State`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a general partnership` `this State`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a limited partnership` `this State`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a limited liability partnership` `this State`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a limited liability limited partnership` `this State`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a joint-stock association` `this State`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `any other unincorporated business or association` `this State`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`) `another jurisdiction of the United States`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`) `a foreign jurisdiction outside the United States`) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`) `this State`) TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a natural person` `this State`) TRUE)
-- "upon the authorization of such conversion in accordance with this section": without it, no
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(a) the corporation may convert to the entity` (`t266 entity` `a limited liability company` `this State`) FALSE)

§ `s 266(b)`

-- Text: the board adopts a resolution approving the conversion, specifying the type of entity and recommending stockholder approval; a plan under (l) is approved together with it.
-- Arguments: resolution adopted, specifies the type of entity, recommends approval, a plan is to be adopted, plan approved together.
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the board of directors has adopted the resolution the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the board of directors has adopted the resolution the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) the board of directors has adopted the resolution the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) the board of directors has adopted the resolution the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) the board of directors has adopted the resolution the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) the board of directors has adopted the resolution the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)

-- Text: due notice "shall be given to each holder of stock, whether voting or nonvoting": a holder of nonvoting stock is entitled to it; a person who holds no stock is not.
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the holder of stock is entitled to due notice of the meeting` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) the holder of stock is entitled to due notice of the meeting` FALSE)

-- Text: notice of the time and purpose, to the address on the corporation's records, "at least 20 days prior to the date of the meeting". Meeting on 30 June 2026: 10 June is the last day.
#ASSERT `s 266(b) notice of the meeting was given to the holder as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 6 10) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 30)
#ASSERT `s 266(b) notice of the meeting was given to the holder as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 6 9) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 30)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) notice of the meeting was given to the holder as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 6 11) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 30))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) notice of the meeting was given to the holder as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 6 30) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 30))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) notice of the meeting was given to the holder as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 30))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) notice of the meeting was given to the holder as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 30))
-- a meeting on 1 March: 20 days before it is 9 February (2026 is not a leap year)
#ASSERT `s 266(b) notice of the meeting was given to the holder as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 2 9) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) notice of the meeting was given to the holder as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 2 10) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1))

-- Text: submitted to the stockholders at an annual or special meeting, where it is considered and a vote taken.
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the resolution was put to the stockholders as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) the resolution was put to the stockholders as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) the resolution was put to the stockholders as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE)

-- Text: "If a majority of the outstanding shares of stock ... entitled to vote thereon shall be voted for the adoption": more than half. 51 of 100 carries; 50 of 100 does not.
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the vote of the stockholders carries the resolution` 51 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the vote of the stockholders carries the resolution` 50 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the vote of the stockholders carries the resolution` 100 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the vote of the stockholders carries the resolution` 0 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the vote of the stockholders carries the resolution` 1 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the vote of the stockholders carries the resolution` 3 5 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the vote of the stockholders carries the resolution` 2 4 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- counts that cannot be a vote are not covered: no outstanding stock entitled to vote; more votes than there are; negative votes
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the vote of the stockholders carries the resolution` 1 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the vote of the stockholders carries the resolution` 101 100 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the vote of the stockholders carries the resolution` (0 MINUS 1) 100 EQUALS NOTHING

-- Text, the proviso: converting to a partnership with 1 or more general partners, each stockholder who will become a general partner must also approve.
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the stockholder must approve the conversion` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) the stockholder must approve the conversion` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(b) the stockholder must approve the conversion` FALSE TRUE)

-- The conversion is authorized when the board has adopted the resolution and a majority has voted for it, and each stockholder who will become a general partner has approved.
-- Arguments: board resolution, no shares issued before it, votes for, votes of the outstanding stock entitled to vote, partnership with general partners, a stockholder becomes one, each such has approved.
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the conversion is authorized by the board and the stockholders` TRUE FALSE 51 100 FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the conversion is authorized by the board and the stockholders` TRUE FALSE 50 100 FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the conversion is authorized by the board and the stockholders` FALSE FALSE 51 100 FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the conversion is authorized by the board and the stockholders` TRUE FALSE 51 100 TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the conversion is authorized by the board and the stockholders` TRUE FALSE 51 100 TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the conversion is authorized by the board and the stockholders` TRUE FALSE 51 100 TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the conversion is authorized by the board and the stockholders` TRUE FALSE 51 100 FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (i): no shares issued before the board adopted the resolution, so no vote of stockholders is necessary: the board's resolution suffices
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the conversion is authorized by the board and the stockholders` TRUE TRUE 0 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the conversion is authorized by the board and the stockholders` FALSE TRUE 0 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- counts that cannot be a vote, with shares issued: not covered
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the conversion is authorized by the board and the stockholders` TRUE FALSE 101 100 FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 266(b) the conversion is authorized by the board and the stockholders` TRUE FALSE 1 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 266(c)`

-- Text: a corporation converting to an entity formed under the laws of a jurisdiction other than Delaware files a certificate of conversion; to a Delaware entity it does not (not covered by this subsection).
#ASSERT `s 266(c) the corporation must file a certificate of conversion with the Secretary of State` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c) the corporation must file a certificate of conversion with the Secretary of State` FALSE)

-- Text, (c)(1)-(7). Arguments: name changed, plan adopted, then the nine certifications (1 1b 2 3 4 5a 5b 6 7).
#ASSERT `s 266(c) the certificate of conversion certifies what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE (`t266 certifications` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 266(c) the certificate of conversion certifies what the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE (`t266 certifications` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c) the certificate of conversion certifies what the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE (`t266 certifications` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT `s 266(c) the certificate of conversion certifies what the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE (`t266 certifications` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c) the certificate of conversion certifies what the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE (`t266 certifications` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c) the certificate of conversion certifies what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE (`t266 certifications` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c) the certificate of conversion certifies what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE (`t266 certifications` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c) the certificate of conversion certifies what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE (`t266 certifications` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c) the certificate of conversion certifies what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE (`t266 certifications` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c) the certificate of conversion certifies what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE (`t266 certifications` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c) the certificate of conversion certifies what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE (`t266 certifications` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c) the certificate of conversion certifies what the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE (`t266 certifications` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE))

-- Text: executed in accordance with section 103 and certifying all that is required.
#ASSERT `s 266(c) the certificate of conversion is as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c) the certificate of conversion is as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c) the certificate of conversion is as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE)

-- Text, (c)(5): the corporation agrees to be served in Delaware; the claimant may serve the Secretary of State in a proceeding of the kinds covered.
#ASSERT `s 266(c)(5) process may be served on the Secretary of State as agent of the converted entity` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(5) process may be served on the Secretary of State as agent of the converted entity` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(5) process may be served on the Secretary of State as agent of the converted entity` FALSE TRUE)

-- Text, (c)(6): electronic service "but only as prescribed by the Secretary of State"; notification "forthwith"; the address "last address designated"; the letter; the plaintiff's duties; the fee as costs; five years.
#ASSERT `s 266(c)(6) the means of serving process on the Secretary of State is permitted` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(6) the means of serving process on the Secretary of State is permitted` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 266(c)(6) the means of serving process on the Secretary of State is permitted` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 266(c)(6) the Secretary of State must forthwith notify the converted entity by letter` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(6) the Secretary of State must forthwith notify the converted entity by letter` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 266(c)(6) the address to which the Secretary of State must mail the letter` "10 Harbor Road" EMPTY EQUALS "10 Harbor Road"
#ASSERT `s 266(c)(6) the address to which the Secretary of State must mail the letter` "10 Harbor Road" (LIST "20 Hill Street") EQUALS "20 Hill Street"
#ASSERT `s 266(c)(6) the address to which the Secretary of State must mail the letter` "10 Harbor Road" (LIST "20 Hill Street", "30 Park Lane") EQUALS "30 Park Lane"
#ASSERT `s 266(c)(6) the letter is sent as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(6) the letter is sent as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(6) the letter is sent as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 266(c)(6) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires of a plaintiff` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(6) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires of a plaintiff` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(6) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires of a plaintiff` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(6) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires of a plaintiff` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 266(c)(6) the fee is taxed as part of the costs in the proceeding` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(6) the fee is taxed as part of the costs in the proceeding` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(6) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of service` (YearMonthDay 2021 6 15) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 15))
#ASSERT `s 266(c)(6) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of service` (YearMonthDay 2021 6 15) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 16)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(6) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of service` (YearMonthDay 2021 6 15) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 14))
-- received on a leap day: five years on is 28 February 2025 (core fork F2)
#ASSERT `s 266(c)(6) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of service` (YearMonthDay 2020 2 29) (YearMonthDay 2025 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(c)(6) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of service` (YearMonthDay 2020 2 29) (YearMonthDay 2025 2 28))

§ `s 266(d)`

-- Text: on the filing (or future effective date) and payment of all fees, the corporation ceases to exist as a corporation of this State at the time the certificate becomes effective under section 103.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(d) the corporation has ceased to exist as a corporation of this State` TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 8 31))
#ASSERT `s 266(d) the corporation has ceased to exist as a corporation of this State` TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1)
#ASSERT `s 266(d) the corporation has ceased to exist as a corporation of this State` TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 9 2)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(d) the corporation has ceased to exist as a corporation of this State` FALSE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 9 2))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(d) the corporation has ceased to exist as a corporation of this State` TRUE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 9 2))
-- Text: "A copy ... certified by the Secretary of State shall be prima facie evidence of the conversion".
#ASSERT `s 266(d) the copy is prima facie evidence of the conversion out of the State of Delaware` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(d) the copy is prima facie evidence of the conversion out of the State of Delaware` FALSE)

§ `s 266(e)`

-- Text: the conversion out is not deemed to affect obligations or liabilities incurred before it, nor personal liability incurred before it, nor the choice of law for matters arising before it. After: not said.
#ASSERT `s 266(e) the conversion is not deemed to affect the obligation or liability` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(e) the conversion is not deemed to affect the obligation or liability` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 266(e) the conversion is not deemed to affect the choice of law applicable to the matter` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(e) the conversion is not deemed to affect the choice of law applicable to the matter` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 266(f)`

-- Text: "Unless otherwise provided in a resolution of conversion ..., the converting corporation shall not be required to wind up ... and the conversion shall not constitute a dissolution".
#ASSERT `s 266(f) the converting corporation is not required to wind up its affairs or pay its liabilities and distribute its assets` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(f) the converting corporation is not required to wind up its affairs or pay its liabilities and distribute its assets` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 266(f) the conversion does not constitute a dissolution of the corporation` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(f) the conversion does not constitute a dissolution of the corporation` TRUE)

§ `s 266(g)`

-- Text: shares may be exchanged for or converted into cash, property, shares, rights or securities of or interests in the new entity, or of or in another domestic corporation or other entity, or cancelled. Any other treatment is not listed.
#ASSERT `s 266(g) the treatment is permitted in connection with a conversion` `exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, the entity to which the corporation is being converted` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(g) the treatment is permitted in connection with a conversion` `exchanged for or converted into cash, property, shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, another domestic corporation or other entity` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(g) the treatment is permitted in connection with a conversion` `cancelled under s 266(g)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(g) the treatment is permitted in connection with a conversion` `any treatment that subsection (g) does not list` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 266(h)`

-- Text: once the conversion is effective: same entity; rights, powers, property, debts due and causes of action vested; title not impaired; creditors' rights and liens preserved; debts attached and enforceable; nothing transferred.
#ASSERT count (`s 266(h) the effects of the conversion` TRUE) EQUALS 6
#ASSERT null (`s 266(h) the effects of the conversion` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 266(h) the effect follows from the conversion` `the other entity or business form is deemed to be the same entity as the corporation under s 266(h)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(h) the effect follows from the conversion` `all rights, privileges and powers, all property and debts due and all things and causes of action of the corporation remain vested in the other entity or business form under s 266(h)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(h) the effect follows from the conversion` `title to real property vested in the corporation does not revert or become impaired under s 266(h)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(h) the effect follows from the conversion` `all rights of creditors and all liens upon property of the corporation are preserved unimpaired under s 266(h)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(h) the effect follows from the conversion` `all debts, liabilities and duties of the corporation remain attached to the other entity or business form and may be enforced against it as if incurred by it in that capacity under s 266(h)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(h) the effect follows from the conversion` `the rights, property, debts, liabilities and duties of the corporation are not deemed to have been transferred to the other entity or business form under s 266(h)` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(h) the effect follows from the conversion` `all rights of creditors and all liens upon property of the corporation are preserved unimpaired under s 266(h)` FALSE)

§ `s 266(i)`

-- Text: "No vote of stockholders ... shall be necessary ... if no shares of the stock of such corporation shall have been issued prior to the adoption by the board of directors of the resolution".
#ASSERT `s 266(i) no vote of stockholders is necessary to authorize the conversion` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(i) no vote of stockholders is necessary to authorize the conversion` FALSE)

§ `s 266(j)`

#ASSERT `s 266(j) the section does not authorize the conversion of the charitable nonstock corporation` `a charitable nonstock corporation` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(j) the section does not authorize the conversion of the charitable nonstock corporation` `a charitable nonstock corporation` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(j) the section does not authorize the conversion of the charitable nonstock corporation` `a stock corporation` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(j) the section does not authorize the conversion of the charitable nonstock corporation` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(j) the section does not authorize the conversion of the charitable nonstock corporation` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` TRUE)

§ `s 266(k)`

-- Text: "a corporation incorporated before August 1, 2022" (strictly before); a voting trust or other written agreement "in effect on or before August 1, 2022" (the day itself counts).
#ASSERT `s 266(k) the date August 1, 2022` EQUALS YearMonthDay 2022 8 1
-- a provision of the certificate of incorporation
#ASSERT `s 266(k) the provision is deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation` `a provision of the certificate of incorporation under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2022 7 31) (YearMonthDay 2022 1 1) TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(k) the provision is deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation` `a provision of the certificate of incorporation under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2022 8 1) (YearMonthDay 2022 1 1) TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(k) the provision is deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation` `a provision of the certificate of incorporation under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2022 8 2) (YearMonthDay 2022 1 1) TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(k) the provision is deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation` `a provision of the certificate of incorporation under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2022 7 31) (YearMonthDay 2022 1 1) FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(k) the provision is deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation` `a provision of the certificate of incorporation under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2022 7 31) (YearMonthDay 2022 1 1) TRUE TRUE)
-- a voting trust or other written agreement: the corporation incorporated before 1 August 2022 and the agreement in effect on or before it
#ASSERT `s 266(k) the provision is deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation` `a provision in a voting trust agreement or other written agreement between the corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2020 5 5) (YearMonthDay 2022 8 1) TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 266(k) the provision is deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation` `a provision in a voting trust agreement or other written agreement between the corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2020 5 5) (YearMonthDay 2022 7 31) TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(k) the provision is deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation` `a provision in a voting trust agreement or other written agreement between the corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2020 5 5) (YearMonthDay 2022 8 2) TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(k) the provision is deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation` `a provision in a voting trust agreement or other written agreement between the corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2022 8 1) (YearMonthDay 2022 8 1) TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(k) the provision is deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation` `a provision in a voting trust agreement or other written agreement between the corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2020 5 5) (YearMonthDay 2022 7 31) FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(k) the provision is deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation` `a provision in a voting trust agreement or other written agreement between the corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2020 5 5) (YearMonthDay 2022 7 31) TRUE TRUE)

§ `s 266(l)`

#ASSERT `s 266(l) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `the terms and conditions of the conversion under s 266(l)(i)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(l) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `that the document governing the internal affairs of the entity to which the corporation is being converted shall be as set forth in an attachment to the plan under s 266(l)(ii)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(l) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `the manner, if any, of exchanging or converting shares of stock of the converting corporation under s 266(l)(iii)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(l) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `any details or provisions that are deemed desirable under s 266(l)(iv)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(l) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `such other provisions or facts as shall be required to be set forth in a plan of conversion by the laws applicable to the entity to which the corporation is being converted under s 266(l)(v)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(l) the plan of conversion may state the matter` `any matter that subsection (l) does not list` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 266(l) the term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the plan` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 266(l) the term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the plan` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 266(l) the term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the plan` FALSE FALSE

§ `The meaning of "facts" (s 266(l))`

-- Text (src:1369): the term "facts" "includes, but is not limited to, the occurrence of any event, including a determination or action by any person or body, including the entity to which the corporation is being converted or the converting corporation".
-- An event, a determination by any person or body and an action by any person or body are facts; for anything else the text does not say (NOTHING; fork F26).
#ASSERT `s 266(l) the kind of fact is within the term facts` `the occurrence of an event under s 266(l)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(l) the kind of fact is within the term facts` `a determination by any person or body, including the entity to which the corporation is being converted or the converting corporation, under s 266(l)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(l) the kind of fact is within the term facts` `an action by any person or body, including the entity to which the corporation is being converted or the converting corporation, under s 266(l)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 266(l) the kind of fact is within the term facts` `something that is neither an event, a determination nor an action under s 266(l)` EQUALS NOTHING
